<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <title>Mantenimiento · Service Unavailable</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light dark;
            --bg: #f8fafc;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
            --text: #0f172a;
            --text-muted: #475569;
            --text-subtle: #64748b;
            --pill-bg: #fef3c7;
            --pill-border: #fde68a;
            --pill-text: #92400e;
            --dot: #d97706;
            --btn-bg: #0f172a;
            --btn-text: #f8fafc;
            --btn-hover: #1e293b;
            --shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root {
                --bg: #0b0f17;
                --surface: #111827;
                --border: #1f2937;
                --text: #f8fafc;
                --text-muted: #9ca3af;
                --text-subtle: #6b7280;
                --pill-bg: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
                --pill-border: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
                --pill-text: #fbbf24;
                --dot: #f59e0b;
                --btn-bg: #f8fafc;
                --btn-text: #0f172a;
                --btn-hover: #e2e8f0;
                --shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            }
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.55;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            max-width: 560px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 2.25rem;
        }

        .header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
        }

        .status-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            background-color: var(--pill-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--pill-border);
            color: var(--pill-text);
            border-radius: 9999px;
            padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: var(--dot);
            animation: pulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.4; }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .status-dot {
                animation: none;
            }
        }

        .icon {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            color: var(--text-subtle);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .lang-block + .lang-block {
            margin-top: 1.35rem;
            padding-top: 1.35rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .lang-label {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.6875rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--text-subtle);
            margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
        }

        h1, h2 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 650;
            letter-spacing: -0.015em;
            color: var(--text);
            margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 0.9375rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 1.75rem;
            padding-top: 1.25rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .retry-btn {
            appearance: none;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background-color: var(--btn-bg);
            color: var(--btn-text);
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 0.8125rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .retry-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--btn-hover);
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .card {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }

            .footer {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="card" role="main">
        <div class="header">
            <span class="status-pill">
                <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                Mantenimiento / Maintenance
            </span>
            <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
                <path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <section class="lang-block" lang="es">
            <span class="lang-label">Español</span>
            <h1>Servicio temporalmente no disponible</h1>
            <p>Estamos realizando tareas de mantenimiento o actualización en este servicio. Volverá a estar operativo en breve.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="lang-block" lang="en">
            <span class="lang-label">English</span>
            <h2>Service temporarily unavailable</h2>
            <p>We are performing scheduled maintenance or updates on this service. It will be back online shortly.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="footer">
            <button type="button" class="retry-btn" onclick="window.location.reload()">Reintentar / Retry</button>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
